OL,3,GNEWSACapybara sighting confirmed as
OL,4,ASamba hunt continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FA missing capybara has been spotted
OL,7,Ffive months after it escaped from a
OL,8,Fzoo.
OL,10,FMarwell Zoo, near Winchester in
OL,11,FHampshire, said it is still searching
OL,12,Ffor one-year-old Samba, who attracted
OL,13,Fglobal interest after she went on the
OL,14,Frun in March.
OL,16,FThe zoo confirmed that the animal was
OL,17,Fspotted by a member of the public on 11
OL,18,FAugust who managed to take a photograph
OL,19,Fof Samba.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
